Function: vul_py_10_1
Root cause analysis: The vulnerability exists in the `get_full_path_with_slash` method which doesn't validate the URL before performing a redirect. This allows an attacker to craft a malicious URL that could redirect users to an untrusted site (open redirect vulnerability). The method trusts the `request.get_host()` value without proper validation.

