Root cause analysis: The `_reverse_with_prefix` method doesn't properly validate URLs when constructing redirect URLs, particularly when handling scheme-relative URLs (starting with //). While it has some protection against scheme-relative URLs, the validation isn't comprehensive enough to prevent all open redirect scenarios.

### Fix Step
